---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="works-voice">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section">
      <TitleLv2 title="お客様の声"/>
      <div class="l-section-body">
        <div class="works-voice-content">
          <ul class="works-voice-list">
            <li class="works-voice-item">見やすく、体験レッスンへの導線が整った、想像以上にいいホームページになりました。</li>
            <li class="works-voice-item">親しみを感じられるホームページになったと思います。
              画面の構成や言葉の選び方もとても分かりやすく、教室の雰囲気を丁寧に形にしていただき嬉しく思います。</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="works-voice-signature">
            <span class="works-voice-signature-title">Ka Pā Hula O Alohilani オーナー</span>
            <span class="works-voice-signature-name">高橋 正子 様</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../../styles/breakpoints' as *;
  .works-voice {
    background-color: var(--color-sub);
  }

  .works-voice-content {
    max-width: calc(720px + 16px);
  }

  .works-voice-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .works-voice-item {
    padding-inline-start: 16px;
    position: relative;

    &::before {
      content: "";
      width: 12px;
      height: 9px;
      background-image: url(/assets/images/global/icon-quote.svg);
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-size: contain;
      background-position: center center;
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left:0;
    }
  }

  .works-voice-signature {
    margin-block-start: 24px;
  }

  .works-voice-signature-title,
  .works-voice-signature-name {
    display: block;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>
